# Secrets
.env
kaggle.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# Data (large / generated — never commit; scripts regenerate it)
data/raw/*
data/synthetic_forgeries/**/*
data/degraded/*
data/processed/*
!data/**/.gitkeep

# Model checkpoints (large binaries — track via Kaggle output / external storage, not git)
checkpoints/*
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.ckpt

# Exception: the real trained LoRA adapter from the first completed SFT run
# (kernel v24, Phase 4 — see PROJECT_STATUS.md). Adapter-only, no optimizer
# state, 36MB total — small enough and important enough as real evidence for
# this portfolio project to version deliberately, unlike routine training
# checkpoints (which include much larger optimizer/scheduler state) that the
# patterns above exist to keep out of the repo by default.
!checkpoints/sft_v24_final/
!checkpoints/sft_v24_final/adapter_config.json
!checkpoints/sft_v24_final/adapter_model.safetensors
!checkpoints/sft_v24_final/README.md

# v25 (r=16 capacity-restoration run, real result documented in
# results/tables/phase4_sft_summary.md) — UNLIKE v24, this adapter's
# safetensors file is 141.8MB, over GitHub's hard 100MB per-file push limit
# (r=16 roughly quadruples trainable params vs v24's r=4: 37.15M vs 9.29M).
# No Git LFS is set up in this repo, and adding one now for a single
# portfolio checkpoint isn't worth the infra complexity — so only the small
# metadata (config + README) is versioned here; the real weights live in the
# Kaggle kernel output (poojadheniya/doc-verification-zero-shot-baseline-sft-qlora,
# kernel version 9) and this dev machine's local disk. A deliberate, documented
# scoping decision, not an oversight.
!checkpoints/sft_v25_final/
!checkpoints/sft_v25_final/adapter_config.json
!checkpoints/sft_v25_final/README.md

# v26 (class-balanced retrain, r=8/384px/seq=2048, tampered examples
# oversampled to a real 1:1 ratio — see results/tables/phase4_sft_summary.md's
# "v26" section). r=8's adapter is ~71MB, under GitHub's 100MB limit, so the
# full safetensors is versioned here, same as v24.
!checkpoints/sft_v26_balanced/
!checkpoints/sft_v26_balanced/adapter_config.json
!checkpoints/sft_v26_balanced/adapter_model.safetensors
!checkpoints/sft_v26_balanced/README.md

# Local Hugging Face model cache (multi-GB; re-downloaded via snapshot_download, not committed)
.hf_cache/

# Notebooks checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Experiment tracking
wandb/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/settings.json
writeup/interview_prep.md
kaggle_loo_output*/
